create a component that creates a parallax floating effect on cursor/touch movement. Works also with videos, svgs, or any type of html elements. There are two components exported from the source file: Floating and FloatingElement. The first one is a wrapper component that takes care of the animation, mouse position tracking and other logic. The second one is a component that you must use to wrap any elements you want to float.

